lgtm!

@evelyndearaujo-goentri did you know you can also refer to the same domain in the redirect without using any external variable, just `%fqdn%` ?
```
    {
      "type": "REDIR301",
      "target": "https://www.%fqdn%",
      "host": "@",
      "groupId": "a2"
    },
```
